ADHD Duck

This project is derived from Angry Duck by hatam-abolghasemi:
https://github.com/hatam-abolghasemi/Angry-Duck

The fork was based on upstream commit
5102a56b8037bce1b249d2e3bbfcd32e55f66d8f (version 1.8.15).
The upstream Apache License, Version 2.0, is retained in LICENSE.
Original authorship and any upstream copyright notices are preserved.

Fork modifications include configuration validation, bounded HTTP inputs,
digest binding, seed capacity safeguards, liveness and GC telemetry fixes,
additional regression tests, and ADHD Duck naming and release coordinates.
See CHANGELOG.md for the maintained change history.
